# StockFlow Architecture

- **api-gateway**: routing, CORS, request ID, rate-limit skeleton — no business logic
- **auth-service**: signup/login/refresh/logout/me, GORM + Postgres, Redis sessions
- **market-service**: Finnhub ingestion, normalization, Redis cache + pub/sub, market HTTP APIs
- **websocket-service**: client WS connections, subscriptions, Redis pub/sub fan-out — no direct Finnhub
- **Frontend**: calls gateway for REST, websocket-service for live ticks; never holds provider keys

Inspect existing code before adding features. Prefer extending over duplicating.
